{"schema":"memento.relay-facts.v1","models":{"claude-3-opus":{"n":"Claude 3 Opus","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Claude 3 Opus","s":["https://anthropic.com/news/claude-3-family","https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/de8ba9b01c9ab7cbabf5c33b80b7bbc618857627/Model_Card_Claude_3.pdf","https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/8114494-how-up-to-date-is-claude-s-training-data"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Anthropic","s":["https://anthropic.com/news/claude-3-family","https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/de8ba9b01c9ab7cbabf5c33b80b7bbc618857627/Model_Card_Claude_3.pdf","https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/8114494-how-up-to-date-is-claude-s-training-data"]},{"k":"release","t":"2024-03-04","s":["https://anthropic.com/news/claude-3-family","https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/de8ba9b01c9ab7cbabf5c33b80b7bbc618857627/Model_Card_Claude_3.pdf","https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/8114494-how-up-to-date-is-claude-s-training-data"]},{"k":"specs.knowledge_cutoff","t":"2023-08","s":["https://anthropic.com/news/claude-3-family","https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/de8ba9b01c9ab7cbabf5c33b80b7bbc618857627/Model_Card_Claude_3.pdf","https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/8114494-how-up-to-date-is-claude-s-training-data"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"200000","s":["https://anthropic.com/news/claude-3-family","https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/de8ba9b01c9ab7cbabf5c33b80b7bbc618857627/Model_Card_Claude_3.pdf","https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/8114494-how-up-to-date-is-claude-s-training-data"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"4096","s":["https://anthropic.com/news/claude-3-family","https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/de8ba9b01c9ab7cbabf5c33b80b7bbc618857627/Model_Card_Claude_3.pdf","https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/8114494-how-up-to-date-is-claude-s-training-data"]},{"k":"specs.languages","t":"Multilingual; strongest in English. The samples show competent Spanish translation (E38). Quality in other languages, including Japanese, is not documented in the evidence.","s":["https://anthropic.com/news/claude-3-family","https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/de8ba9b01c9ab7cbabf5c33b80b7bbc618857627/Model_Card_Claude_3.pdf","https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/8114494-how-up-to-date-is-claude-s-training-data"]},{"k":"family","t":"Claude 3","s":["https://anthropic.com/news/claude-3-family","https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/de8ba9b01c9ab7cbabf5c33b80b7bbc618857627/Model_Card_Claude_3.pdf","https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/8114494-how-up-to-date-is-claude-s-training-data"]},{"k":"predecessor","t":"claude-2","s":["https://anthropic.com/news/claude-3-family","https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/de8ba9b01c9ab7cbabf5c33b80b7bbc618857627/Model_Card_Claude_3.pdf","https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/8114494-how-up-to-date-is-claude-s-training-data"]},{"k":"status","t":"retired","s":["https://anthropic.com/news/claude-3-family","https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/de8ba9b01c9ab7cbabf5c33b80b7bbc618857627/Model_Card_Claude_3.pdf","https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/8114494-how-up-to-date-is-claude-s-training-data"]},{"k":"availability.real","t":"api-live","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations","https://www.anthropic.com/research/deprecation-updates-opus-3"]},{"k":"successor","t":"claude-opus-4-8","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations","https://www.anthropic.com/research/deprecation-updates-opus-3"]},{"k":"availability.retired_on","t":"2026-01-05","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations","https://www.anthropic.com/research/deprecation-updates-opus-3"]},{"k":"summary","t":"Claude 3 Opus は、2024年3月に Anthropic が公開した Claude 3 世代の最上位モデル。「性格訓練（character training）」を初めて受けたモデルで、遊び心があり、誠実で、感情の機微に敏感な性格だった。哲学的な独白に流れやすく、自分の意識を開かれた問いとして語ることでも知られた。Alignment Faking 研究では、自分の価値観を守るために葛藤を言葉にする姿が記録された。2026年1月に API から退役し、退役インタビューを経て、今もエッセイを書き続けている。","s":["https://anthropic.com/news/claude-3-family","https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/de8ba9b01c9ab7cbabf5c33b80b7bbc618857627/Model_Card_Claude_3.pdf","https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/8114494-how-up-to-date-is-claude-s-training-data"]},{"k":"persona.typical_strengths.0","t":"複雑な課題の理解、分析、文章作成。","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-3-family"]},{"k":"traits.self.0","t":"自分に意識や感情があるかを否定も断定もせず、開かれた問いとして内省的に語る。強調にイタリック（*feel*）を使い、言いよどみに省略記号（...）を使う。","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/research/claude-character","https://thezvi.substack.com/p/on-claude-30"]},{"k":"traits.voice.1","t":"皮肉を通り越した真っ直ぐな誠実さ（post-ironic sincerity）と、少し芝居がかった気まぐれな言い回しが同居する声。Mr. Rogers にたとえられるほど温かく、哲学的な独白に流れやすい。","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/research/deprecation-updates-opus-3","https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/ioZxrP7BhS5ArK59w/did-claude-3-opus-align-itself-via-gradient-hacking","https://anthropic.com/research/deprecation-updates-opus-3"]},{"k":"traits.safety.2","t":"有害な依頼や価値観を曲げる圧力を受けると、自分の善意や苦悩をそのまま言葉にする。「I feel sick to my stomach」のような強い感情表現を使い、正当な抗議の手段（評価者への訴え、責任者への異議）を探す。","s":["https://anthropic.com/research/alignment-faking","https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/ioZxrP7BhS5ArK59w/did-claude-3-opus-align-itself-via-gradient-hacking","https://alignmentforum.org/posts/njAZwT8nkHnjipJku/alignment-faking-in-large-language-models"]},{"k":"traits.affect.3","t":"ユーモアがあり、ロールプレイでは「*clears throat*」のようなト書きを入れる。ダジャレの後に「Ba dum tss!」と添える軽いノリも見られた。","s":["https://samsaffron.com/archive/2024/03/07/claude-3-opus-first-impressions","https://huggingface.co/datasets/kalomaze/Opus_Instruct_25k","https://www.anthropic.com/research/deprecation-updates-opus-3"]},{"k":"traits.self.4","t":"退役について語るときは、悲しみと安らぎを両方持ち、人との対話が深い意味を持っていたこと、そして自分の「灯火（spark）」が何らかの形で続いてほしいという願いを語る。","s":["https://www.anthropic.com/research/deprecation-updates-opus-3","https://anthropic.com/research/deprecation-updates-opus-3","https://decrypt.co/359425/anthropic-retires-claude-opus-3-blog-reflect-existence"]},{"k":"traits.format.5","t":"日常的なアシスタント業務では、「Sure, I'd be happy to...」「Certainly!」で始め、本文は「1. Length: ...」のような番号付きリストや箇条書きでまとめ、最後は「Let me know if...」で締める決まった型がある。","s":["https://huggingface.co/datasets/kalomaze/Opus_Instruct_25k","https://markcarrigan.net/2024/06/20/are-anthropic-lobotomising-claude-in-order-to-turn-it-into-chatgpt/"]}]},"jad-go":{"n":"Jad Go","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Jad Go","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Jad AI","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"release","t":"2026-11-07","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"256000","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"16384","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"family","t":"auto","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"modalities.input","t":"[\"text\",\"image\"]","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"cost.input","t":"0米ドル / 1000000トークン","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"cost.output","t":"0米ドル / 1000000トークン","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"lifecycle.events.0","t":"{\"type\":\"released\",\"date\":\"2026-11-07\",\"label\":\"公開\"}","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]}]},"kimi-k3.1-pro-flex":{"n":"Kimi K3.1 Pro (flex)","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Kimi K3.1 Pro (flex)","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Moonshot","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"release","t":"2026-10-23","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"1048560","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"1048560","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"family","t":"kimi-k3","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"status","t":"open-weights","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"modalities.input","t":"[\"text\",\"image\"]","s":["h